# Forest Blitzer: a rhino beetle. Low, wide and horned: a little battering ram.
size 7 5 7
voxel 0.11
colors
  P purple
  d purpleDark
  l purpleLight
  w white
  k ink
  h horn
# Legs, sticking out at the sides.
box 0 0 2 0 0 2 k
box 6 0 2 6 0 2 k
box 0 0 4 0 0 4 k
box 6 0 4 6 0 4 k
box 0 0 6 0 0 6 k
box 6 0 6 6 0 6 k
# The shell, with a shiny stripe down the middle.
box 1 0 2 5 2 6 P
box 2 3 2 4 3 6 P
box 3 3 2 3 3 6 l
box 3 2 2 3 2 6 l
# Head, eyes and a short horn curling up and back at the front.
box 2 0 1 4 1 1 d
box 2 1 1 2 1 1 w
box 4 1 1 4 1 1 w
box 3 1 0 3 2 0 h
box 3 3 1 3 3 1 h
